# NK conformance driver nkc-ex (the executive).
#
# One request runs the driver's checks of push locks, sequenced lists,
# lookaside lists, executive resources, executive timers, ExUuidCreate
# and the pool routines, and returns the values it logged, 32 bits each,
# ending with 0x4E4B4321. What each value means is written beside it in
# nk-fixtures nkc/nkc-ex.c.

load nkc-ex nkc-ex.sys
open d \Device\NkcEx
ioctl d 00222000 - 16384
close d
unload nkc-ex
